    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a certain superstitious fictional country, there is popular belief to hang a flower garland inside the car to worship the &quot;protector&quot; of a car for good luck and safe traveling. Those flower garlands are crafted by hand and conveniently sold around the intersection to those cars waiting at red light. That's where your job comes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garland Boy</strong> is a game about a boy who earns his living by selling flower garlands and various goods to cars waiting in a traffic light at the intersection while following his dream to get into a good school. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only working and saving money, there are also side gigs to do in the weekend, and the ultimate goal is to prepare for upcoming school entrance exam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/ad1505006cec3440ae5c1e229d52ceaa.poster.avif?t=1749181589\" width=500 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/ad1505006cec3440ae5c1e229d52ceaa.webm?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/ad1505006cec3440ae5c1e229d52ceaa.mp4?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell more goods, more profit!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with flower garland, upgrade skills, expand the catalog, reel in more profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/d4bd3009c24e858b018a61a46b85aec0.poster.avif?t=1749181589\" width=500 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/d4bd3009c24e858b018a61a46b85aec0.webm?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/d4bd3009c24e858b018a61a46b85aec0.mp4?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the negotiation skill!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer not interested in buying? Ask them nicely. \ud83d\ude4f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/5817d7299e40c9e24e7fd1d47b916bc1.poster.avif?t=1749181589\" width=500 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/5817d7299e40c9e24e7fd1d47b916bc1.webm?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/5817d7299e40c9e24e7fd1d47b916bc1.mp4?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work on side gigs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is money, do various weekend side gigs to help get closer to his dream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/387602276dda2a4d7ed8fce7324ca0bd.poster.avif?t=1749181589\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/387602276dda2a4d7ed8fce7324ca0bd.webm?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/387602276dda2a4d7ed8fce7324ca0bd.mp4?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet your friends at school</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our school is a nice place to be and all the teachers are kind. (?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/e8590b303a93107fa9885b3cf1c58e6e.avif?t=1749181589\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never neglect your study</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete math drills, prepare yourself for an upcoming school admission exam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If he can get into prestigious school, could this be a big turning point in his life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/d95bbb980803fc452a97b200e18db916.poster.avif?t=1749181589\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/d95bbb980803fc452a97b200e18db916.webm?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/d95bbb980803fc452a97b200e18db916.mp4?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utilize supernatural power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make an offer to the sprit house and receive blessings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/6fb416a468a07f00a25a8b3fd51a50b3.poster.avif?t=1749181589\" width=500 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/6fb416a468a07f00a25a8b3fd51a50b3.webm?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837950/extras/6fb416a468a07f00a25a8b3fd51a50b3.mp4?t=1749181589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
